34	 * (b) reading `vaultStore.rootIpnsName` after a real login to identify the
35	 * account's own root IPNS name, and (c) writing a durable seq high-water floor
36	 * directly into IndexedDB to STAGE the ROT-07 anti-rollback condition. (a)/(b)
37	 * are read-only observation; only (c) writes app rotation state -- it seeds the
38	 * exact durable "this device already saw a higher sequence" memory the SC#4
39	 * gate consumes, because the relay-replay path cannot reach the client through
40	 * the real resolve (see the SC#4 test's own comment for the full rationale).
41	 */
